Subject: Cantor Identity Admission Judgment Gate P4 Requirement Matrix

& [RequirementMatrix]
  + IAG-01 deny-unknown-fields proposal form is implemented by AccountableObjectAdmission
  + IAG-02 exact source ledger and stale refusal are exercised without source mutation
  + IAG-03 digest-valid version-one absent candidate is enforced and version duplicate fixtures refuse
  + IAG-04 nonempty exact provenance evidence equality is enforced and mismatch refuses
  + IAG-05 existing FacultyCycle.validate is invoked before admission-specific gates and malformed return coverage refuses
  + IAG-06 semantic transition all-seven active and zero omission requirements are enforced
  + IAG-07 subject canonical before-state and candidate after-state bindings are enforced and substitution refuses
  + IAG-08 Observer admit is enforced and block refuses
  + IAG-09 accepted objection-free uncertainty-free returns are enforced and qualified or uncertain cases refuse
  + IAG-10 zero cycle residual is enforced and residual case refuses
  + IAG-11 canonical self-excluding admission digest detects identity substitution
  + IAG-12 one insertion one generation increment digest refresh and successor validation are asserted
  + IAG-13 source ledger and proposal equality are retained across success and refusal fixtures
  + IAG-14 equal input produces equal successor in deterministic replay fixture
  + IAG-15 five focused fixtures cover success stale duplicate disposition qualification uncertainty residual invalid cycle evidence version binding and digest tamper
  + IAG-16 no model IO persistence journal MCP effect or publication is verified by static module boundary inspection

& [FormationState] is all_requirements_implemented_and_locally_verified_pending_clean_replay
